        "official_en_sha256": "0e88eaedc55739a50885ac4cbbd86baccf9b741f247bdb3203361208a6bf4f99"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "昔、おばあちゃんがね、\r\n雷鳴山の隠し道で大きな人影を見たんだって。\r\n幻獣かなぁ？　って言っていたけど……",
        "official_en": "I’m not sure if this has anything to do with that, but Granny once told me she saw some huge figure on the hidden path on Mt. Thunderclap. She said it might’ve been an esper.",
        "real_en": "My grandma once told me she'd seen a huge figure on a hidden path up Mt. Thunderclap. She wondered if it might have been an Eidolon..."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
