      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "隠し道のことが気になる？\r\n実は、ドワーフの工房側に\r\n別の入口があるのよね……。",
        "official_en": "Oh, you want to know about the hidden path? Well, there’s an entrance close to the Dwarven Forge.",
        "real_en": "Curious about the hidden path? Actually, there's another entrance near the Dwarven Forge..."
      },
