      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "雷、鳴り止まぬ雷鳴山。\r\nそれは自然のとどろきか、裁きの雷か。\r\nなんていうんだけど……。",
        "official_en": "It goes something like this: the peals that resound from Mt. Thunderclap—are they the cries of nature, or the echoes of judgment?",
        "real_en": null
      },
